OL,3,CMan admits preventing lawful burial of
OL,4,Cfatal arson attack suspect
OL,6,FA man has admitted to preventing a
OL,7,Flawful burial after the body of a
OL,8,Fsuspect in a fatal arson attack was
OL,9,Ffound in a wheelie bin.
OL,11,FThe body of Paul Smith, 40, known as
OL,12,FSmigger, was found in the bin in
OL,13,FEverton, Liverpool, on July 22, seven
OL,14,Fdays after he is believed to have
OL,15,Fstarted a fire at the home of Sheila
OL,16,FJackson, 83, and her partner Eric
OL,17,FGreener, 77, in St Helens, Merseyside.
OL,19,FThe couple were rescued from the blaze
OL,20,Fbut died in hospital from burns and
OL,21,Fsmoke inhalation.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
