FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786119514
OL,3,CMan admits preventing lawful burial of
OL,4,Cfatal arson attack suspect
OL,6,FAppearing at Liverpool Crown Court on
OL,7,FFriday, Steven Wales, 61, pleaded
OL,8,Fguilty to preventing the lawful and
OL,9,Fdecent burial of Mr Smith's body.
OL,11,FThe case was adjourned until 18 August
OL,12,Fto allow Mr Smith's family to make
OL,13,Fvictim personal statements.
OL,15,FJudge Brian Cummings KC granted Wales
OL,16,Funconditional bail but told him: "All
OL,17,Foptions remain open, that includes the
OL,18,Fpossibility of an immediate prison
OL,19,Fsentence, so you must come on the next
OL,20,Foccasion ready for all options."
OL,26,@xD@bOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
