OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786119514
OL,3,CMan admits preventing lawful burial of
OL,4,Cfatal arson attack suspect
OL,6,FBefore leaving the court, Wales said:
OL,7,F"Have a good day, your honour."
OL,9,FAn inquest last month heard Mr Smith's
OL,10,Fbody was discovered in a bin where it
OL,11,Fhad been moved after he died in a
OL,12,Fbath, having taken a cocktail of drugs.
OL,14,FThe hearing at the Gerard Majella
OL,15,FCourthouse in Liverpool was told Wales
OL,16,Fcalled police on July 22 and told them
OL,17,Fa man had either drowned or overdosed
OL,18,Fin the bath at a property at Coniston
OL,19,FStreet, Everton, two days earlier.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786119514
OL,3,CMan admits preventing lawful burial of
OL,4,Cfatal arson attack suspect
OL,6,FMr Smith's body was found in a wheelie
OL,7,Fbin at the rear of derelict properties
OL,8,Fnearby.
OL,10,FIn a report, Home Office pathologist
OL,11,FDr Matthew Lyall said toxicology
OL,12,Fresults showed Mr Smith had taken
OL,13,Fheroin close to the time of his death,
OL,14,Fas well as a "relatively large amount
OL,15,Fof cocaine" and a number of sedatives.
OL,17,FDr Lyall said drowning could not be
OL,18,Fproved or excluded.
OL,26,@vD@NOUwD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786119514
OL,3,CMan admits preventing lawful burial of
OL,4,Cfatal arson attack suspect
OL,6,FHe added: "Neither can it be entirely
OL,7,Fexcluded that the deceased was held
OL,8,Funder water by a third party, but
OL,9,Fpathological findings cannot prove
OL,10,Fthat occurred."
OL,12,FRecording the death as drug-related,
OL,13,Fthe coroner said: "He died from taking
OL,14,Fillicit and sedative drugs which
OL,15,Fcaused respiratory failure."
OL,17,FEarlier this year Kevin Weetman, 34,
OL,18,FKylie Maynard, 37, and Lee Owens, 46,
OL,19,Fwere jailed for the manslaughter of Mr
OL,20,FGreener and Ms Jackson.
OL,26,@nD@KOUrD@OO]uD@SOUwD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
